{
  "id": "EUVD-2026-126981",
  "enisaUuid": "cf178ded-19b7-3d25-abd9-da9acaba8374",
  "description": "The file dump controller (eID=dumpFile) delivers files, file references and processed files identified by their uid, protected by a token. The token only covered the uid value, but not the type of the requested resource. A valid token issued for a file could therefore be reused to request a file reference or a processed file with the same uid. As a result, unauthenticated visitors could download files, for example from non-public storages, for which no token had been issued.",
